	<element name="Crucible Storm Chaser" type="Background" source="Arcana Unleashed" id="ID_WOTC_AU_BACKGROUND_CRUCIBLE_STORM_CHASER">
		<description>
			<ul class="unstyled" style="text-indent:-1em; margin-left:1em; margin-bottom:5px">
				<li><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Intelligence</li>
				<li><strong>Feat:</strong> Arcane Overload</li>
				<li><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Athletics and Nature</li>
				<li><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Glassblower's Tools</li>
				<li><strong>Equipment:</strong><i> Choose A or B:</i> (A) Glassblower's Tools, Backpack, Rope, Traveler's Clothes, 15 GP; or (B) 50 GP</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Your daredevil tendencies and thirst for excitement led you to the Crucible Keepers, an organization dedicated to studying natural and magical catastrophes. From playing with molten glass to charging into a hurricane's eye, you thrive when disaster is mere steps away.</p>
			<div class="reference">
				<div element="ID_WOTC_AU_FEAT_ARCANE_OVERLOAD" />
			</div>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="short">Strength, Constitution, Intelligence, Arcane Overload Feat, Athletics and Nature Skills, Glassblower's Tools</set>
		</setters>
		<rules>
			<grant type="Ability Score Improvement" id="ID_INTERNAL_ABILITY_SCORE_IMPROVEMENT_COMBINATION_STR_CON_INT" />
			<grant type="Feat" id="ID_WOTC_AU_FEAT_ARCANE_OVERLOAD" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_ATHLETICS" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_NATURE" />
			<grant type="Grants" id="ID_INTERNAL_GRANTS_BACKGROUND_ASI" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_TOOL_PROFICIENCY_GLASSBLOWERS_TOOLS" />
		</rules>
	</element>
</elements>
